<title>JAPAN: Mitsumi Electric shares bid-only.</title>
<headline>Mitsumi Electric shares bid-only.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Mitsumi Electric Co Ltd were bid-only at 2,190 yen on the Tokyo Stock Exchange on Tuesday morning after the company forecast robust earnings for the half year to March 31, brokers said.  </p>
<p>The company said on Monday that it expects to post sales of 130 billion yen in the six-month period ending March 31, up from the previous forecast of 117 billion yen.</p>
<p>It also said its parent current profit is expected to reach 6.5 billion yen, up from the previous forecast of three billion yen.</p>
</text>
